      "put": {
        "summary": "修改VDC(已废弃)",
        "x-resource": "租户管理",
        "description": "修改VDC,只支持修改VDC名称及描述字段。\n接口已废弃,建议使用PUT /rest/vdc/v3.1/vdcs/{vdc_id}替代。\n\ncurl调用示例:\n```\ncurl -v -H \"Content-Type:application/json\" -H \"x-auth-token: ******\" -X PUT -d \"{json}\" \"https://{endpoint}/rest/vdc/v3.0/vdcs/113f4394-2f54-472f-b03f-aacbd98f9cb4\"\n```\n\n|SLA项|定义|\n|-----|-----|\n|请求成功率| >=99.9%|\n|可用性|Tier1|\n|数据一致性|最终一致,不一致时长<1分钟|\n|吞吐量|60次/分钟|\n|吞吐量|10次/秒|\n|TP50请求时延|1500ms|\n|TP99.9请求时延|3000ms|",
        "x-precautions": "错误码:当请求不成功时,响应体内的错误码信息请参见“ManageOne 运营面API参考 > 错误码说明 > VDC特性”章节。",
        "tags": [
          "VDC"
        ],
        "operationId": "UpdateVDC",
        "produces": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "consumes": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "x-auth-token",
